{"step_index":1017,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:34:38Z","thinking":"**Verifying proof completeness**\n\nThe `eccentricity_le_of_ballWithin_eq_univ` proof is complete and kernel-checked. The previously proven lemmas, `finset_min_getD_le_of_mem`, `radius_le_eccentricity` and `eccentricity_le_of_ballWithin_eq_univ` are reviewed to ensure progress is tracked.\n\n\n**Connecting total domination to radius**\n\nThe definition of `totalDominationNumber G` involves `minCard`, the minimum cardinality of a total dominating set. The goal is to prove `radius G ≤ totalDominationNumber G`. If `radius G ≤ S.card` holds for every total dominating set $S$, then this must also hold for the minimum cardinality set.\n\nThe `minCard` definition ensures that `totalDominationNumber G` is the cardinality of some total dominating set. The existence of such a set is confirmed when a graph has a total domination number. Therefore, showing `radius G ≤ S.card` for *any* total dominating set will imply the desired inequality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat << 'EOF' >> scratch.lean\n\nlemma exists_totalDominatingSet_card_eq {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    (ht : GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber G) :\n    ∃ s : Finset V, GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G s ∧ s.card = GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber G := by\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber, GraphCalc.HasWitness] at ht\n  rcases ht with ⟨s0, hs0mem, hs0dom⟩\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber, GraphCalc.minCard]\n  let T := Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset)\n  have hne : s0.card ∈ T := by\n    apply Finset.mem_image.mpr\n    refine ⟨s0, ?_, rfl⟩\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\n    exact ⟨hs0mem, hs0dom⟩\n  have hnonempty : T.Nonempty := ⟨s0.card, hne⟩\n  have hmin := Finset.min'_mem T hnonempty\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hmin\n  rcases hmin with ⟨s, hs, hscard⟩\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hs\n  refine ⟨s, hs.2, ?_⟩\n  rw [← hscard]\n  have hmin_eq : T.min = WithTop.some (T.min' hnonempty) := Finset.min_eq_some_iff.mpr ⟨hnonempty, rfl⟩\n  -- wait, let's see how Finset.min relates to min'\n  sorry\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Testing exists_totalDominatingSet","toolSummary":"Test exists_totalDominatingSet"}}]}
